 <h2 class="section-title text-center">Three things we're built to do well.</h2>
 <p class="lead text-center">In addition to rigorous process and quality control, here's what we hear matters most when an office picks an infusion partner.</p>
 <div class="grid grid--3 mt-6">
 <div class="card"><h3>Easy to refer.</h3><p>One streamlined referral of your choice: online, fax, or phone. No hoops, no chasing. We confirm we have it, so you are never left guessing.</p></div>
 <div class="card"><h3>Speed to service.</h3><p>We move fast on authorizations and offer your patient the earliest appointment we can as soon as coverage clears. If they'd rather wait for a day that fits their schedule, that's their call. The speed is there when they want it.</p></div>
 <div class="card"><h3>We close the loop.</h3><p>After every infusion, the nursing note goes back to your office. Every time. What was given, how your patient tolerated it, and the follow-up plan. You're never left wondering.</p></div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>

